{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>ביומו</b> — it is attached to the word יום." "<b>The meaning of ביומו</b> — that which is fitting for the thing. And likewise <b>מדי חדש בחדשו</b> is attached to מדי, for it is like the meaning of עת וזמן."], :book :ezra, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Ezra -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:41:44.754857898Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}